IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
AUTHOR. 'TREVOR LITTLE'.
PROGRAM-ID. GRADES.

DATA DIVISION.
  WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 WS-CORRECT PIC 9(3).
    01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(3).
    01 WS-PERCENT PIC 9(1)V9(2).

    01 WS-LETTER PIC A(1).
  
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  DISPLAY 'HELLO'.
  ACCEPT WS-CORRECT FROM CONSOLE.
  ACCEPT WS-TOTAL FROM CONSOLE.
  DIVIDE WS-CORRECT BY WS-TOTAL GIVING WS-PERCENT ROUNDED.
  DISPLAY WS-PERCENT.

  IF WS-PERCENT >= .90 THEN
    MOVE 'A' TO WS-LETTER.
    
  IF WS-PERCENT >= .80 AND WS-PERCENT <= .89 THEN
    MOVE 'B' TO WS-LETTER.
    
  IF WS-PERCENT >= .70 AND WS-PERCENT <= .79 THEN
    MOVE 'C' TO WS-LETTER.
  
  IF WS-PERCENT >= .60 AND WS-PERCENT <= .69 THEN
    MOVE 'D' TO WS-LETTER.
    
  IF WS-PERCENT <= .59 THEN
    MOVE 'F' TO WS-LETTER.
  
  DISPLAY 'LETTER: ' WS-LETTER.
